    {
      "id": "claim_5f37c6f3fd0d4b7daf65acc42b1cb6c1",
      "statement": "The assembled agent middleware order (outer to inner) is FilesystemMiddleware, AnthropicPromptCachingMiddleware, ConversationOffloadingMiddleware, PrepareAgentRunMiddleware, optional ReviewGuideMiddleware, TranscriptMiddleware, optional ClientToolsMiddleware, optional IncidentMiddleware, optional WorkspaceSkillsMiddleware, ValidateImageReadsMiddleware, ModelCallLimitMiddleware, ToolErrorMiddleware, ExcludeToolsMiddleware, SubdirAgentsReadMiddleware, ToolRetryMiddleware, optional PullRequestCreationGuardMiddleware (non-local), optional TaskCoordinationMiddleware, WorkflowPushGuardMiddleware, refresh_github_proxy_before_model (unless worker mode), check_message_queue_before_model and deliver_event_matches_before_model (except stop-summary mode), RequireUserReplyMiddleware, optional RequireCliResultMiddleware, notify_step_limit_reached, record_run_usage, ModelSelectionMiddleware (conditional), ModelFallbackMiddleware (conditional), ImageModelFallbackMiddleware (conditional), optional DynamicToolMiddleware, optional CodeModeMiddleware, three message sanitizers, StableToolResultOrderMiddleware, ModelErrorMiddleware, and ModelCallTimeoutMiddleware (innermost).",
